 build, while artifacts you pick up mid-run stack into powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803280/extras/976e6e504cfb1581b9fa2947950babf1.poster.avif?t=1765569649\" width=652 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803280/extras/976e6e504cfb1581b9fa2947950babf1.webm?t=1765569649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803280/extras/976e6e504cfb1581b9fa2947950babf1.mp4?t=1765569649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Black Dawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dragon Guernian has fallen, and his Corruption twists the world. You must fight your way to the Citadel at the center of the rift. But be warned: the history you know is a lie. Track down major bosses, piece together the fragments of the past, and discover what the Black Dawn is really doing with the Corruption.</p>","developers":["TeamSuneat"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803280/05bb25ba422784bcef9e5b8a95e9c7e4094570ea/header.jpg?t=1765569649","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 PM Studios, Inc. Dragon is Dead is a registered trademark of PM Studios, Inc. Created and developed by TeamSuneat, a subsidiary of PM Studios, Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2803280/647453762/b83dd664e78a92a689c44ef89b76fd4b9f52fda0/1750820118/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749214519","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2803280/647453762/b83dd664e78a92a689c44ef89b76fd4b9f52fda0/175082